  "id": "lamb-shoulder-chops",
  "name": "Lamb Shoulder Chops",
  "subtitle": "Tender lamb with rosemary pan sauce",
  "description": "Browned lamb shoulder chops pressure-cooked with onion, garlic, red wine, consomme, and rosemary, then finished with a quick thickened sauce.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
